# Groq keys — each one a separate free account = a separate quota bucket.
# Rotated automatically on rate limits (429s), most-recently-added last.
# console.groq.com → API Keys → Create (shown once, copy immediately)
# One key is enough to run. Add more (GROQ_API_KEY_2, _3, _4, ...) for more
# daily headroom — useful for a busy multi-day expo. Any gaps are fine.
GROQ_API_KEY=
GROQ_API_KEY_2=
# GROQ_API_KEY_3=
# GROQ_API_KEY_4=

# Optional — powers live web search for time-sensitive questions ("who is the
# current PM of X"). Free, no card required. tavily.com → sign up → API Keys.
# App works fine without it — those questions just get an honest "I don't
# have that info" instead of a live answer. Same numbered pattern as Groq
# above for extra quota (each free account gets 1,000 searches/month):
TAVILY_API_KEY=
# TAVILY_API_KEY_2=
